// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : David_Wincott 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 35 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : David Wincott 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P2609055116" "David Wincott"
// ProfessionString :
"P1730609096" "Policeman"
// DescriptionString :
"P1112754236" "Lieutenant David Wincott was just a beat cop with a nine to five shift until his son, Sam, was kidnapped by the Trolls four years ago. Now, he's a man with a mission. After the kidnapping, Wincott asked to be reassigned to the Paragon City Trolls Task Force. It's a dangerous job that's cost many of his comrades their lives, but to Wincott, the risk is worth it. Although his friends keep telling him to make his peace with the past, Wincott's never stopped hoping that one day he'll be reunited with his son."
// HelloString :
"P3350360609" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>The Trolls are up to their old tricks.</a>"
// HelloString :
"P2062547282" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>There's a situation that needs your attention.</a>"
// HelloString :
"P2457457443" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Ready to reclaim the Hollows?</a>"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P412396594" "I'm sorry, but, as a member of the Trolls Task Force, I can only speak with authorized heroes. Perhaps you should see if {LastContactName} has any new assignments."
// FirstVisitString :
"P3434910057" "So you're {HeroName}, huh? I hope you're as good as your reputation. These Trolls are vicious, but, with your help, I hope to take them out."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P1860755927" "You've done all I could ask of you, my friend. Perhaps your other contacts know of someone who needs your help."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P1073673840" "You're overworked, kid. Finish some of your current missions; then we'll talk."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P310877974" "I can't give this mission to anyone below Security Level {Level}."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P3150522730" "You've become a true friend, {HeroName}. The next time you enter the field, I'd like you to take along a few of these new <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>Enhancements.</a> And take my number. You never know when you might need a hand."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P2761452795" "I think I may trust you more than any man on my team. I've requisitioned some <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>new gear,</a> if you'd like to take a look."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P1929281071" "The time has come for you to move on to greater challenges."
// LocationString :
"P4227375565" "The Hollows"
// IntroString :
"P2755146593" "I'd like you to have a chat with David Wincott. He's a lieutenant on the Paragon City Trolls Task Force, and he knows a lot about what's going on in the Hollows."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P3302884236" "Choose David Wincott"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P1202675629" "David's son was kidnapped by the Trolls four years ago. That's a cross he still carries."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P1501737324" "I have <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>someone</a> I'd like you to meet."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P850373190" "I have a couple of <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>people</a> I want you to meet."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


