// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Karsis 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 35 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Karsis 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P2596096903" "Karsis"
// ProfessionString :
"P1964476189" "Coerced Circle Mage"
// DescriptionString :
"P1090825463" "Much to his fury, Karsis has come under the magical control of Talshak the Mystic. Against his wishes, he will be forced to tell you the location of the Cavern of Transcendence."
// LocationString :
// DontHaveToken :
"P162494564" "You think I would talk to the likes of you? Hah! I suggest you learn more about the Hollows before approaching me again. <br><br><color deepskyblue>You must complete Talshak's story arc in order to open this Taskforce. You will need at least 8 members on your team, all of them at least Level 12. If they are over Level 15, they will be automatically exemplared to Level 15 for the duration of the Task Force.</color>"
// TaskForceInvite :
"P4289390796" "Talshak has forced me to reveal the cavern's location to you, and only you. Make no mistake; if I could, I would kill you on the spot. But the old mage's power is too strong. <A HREF={ACCEPT}>I will lead you to the cavern.</a> Whatever happens there, you're on your own."
// PlayerLevelTooLow :
"P2043415458" "Pitiful creature! You are not yet strong enough to face the trials of the Cavern of Transcendence! <br><br><color deepskyblue>You need at least 8 members on your team, all of them at least Level 12. If they are over Level 15, they will be automatically exemplared to Level 15 for the duration of the Task Force.</color>"
// PlayerLevelTooHigh :
"P3660618118" "You're too big to be hanging around here. There are great dangers ahead of you, which I sincerely hope will be your doom. <br><br><color deepskyblue>You need at least 8 members on your team, all of them at least Level 12. If they are over Level 15, they will be automatically exemplared to Level 15 for the duration of the Task Force.</color>"
// NeedLargeTeam :
"P2617457428" "Only eight heroes together can master the Cavern of Transcendence. <br><br><color deepskyblue>You need at least 8 members on your team, all of them at least Level 12. If they are over Level 15, they will be automatically exemplared to Level 15 for the duration of the Task Force.</color>"
// NeedTeamLeader :
"P866568627" "I'll address your leader, and no one else."
// NeedTeamOnMap :
"P2523096280" "Everyone's not here yet. So I'm not talking."
// BadTeamLevel :
"P1547642431" "Some members of your team don't meet the requirements for my next task. <br><br><color deepskyblue>You need at least 8 members on your team, all of them at least Level 12. If they are over Level 15, they will be automatically exemplared to Level 15 for the duration of the Task Force.</color>"
// TaskForceName :
"P382173820" "Task Force Wretched Mortals"
// TaskForceName :
"P1126529389" "Task Force Pathetic Humans"
// TaskForceName :
"P3216890631" "Task Force Doomed Mortals"
// HelloString :
"P1026285443" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>All right, all right. I'll help</a>"
// HelloString :
"P3438670462" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Talshak commands me.</a>"
// HelloString :
"P866397604" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>There is danger ahead, and I hope it kills you.</a>"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P150106681" "I have no interest in you, though the fool {LastContactName} may."
// FirstVisitString :
"P4095194782" "Know that if I could work my will, you would writhe in pain until you died. Still, I am at Talshak's command. I will assist you."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P3807515480" "We're done here."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P2409670618" "You are more crafty than I thought, heroes. Still, the Circle will best you some day! I suppose you may contact me, if you wish."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P1593979376" "You are impressive, I must admit. The Circle will have to keep tabs on you."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P856364347" ""
// IntroString :
"P2407322049" "I want you meet strange fellow: Talshak the Mystic. He a confusing man, but I know he wants to stop Trolls and Igneous. Talshak seems to have an unending supply of Natural and Magic Enhancements."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P674348046" "Choose Talshak the Mystic"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P3276798560" "Talshak keep talking about strange mystic gateway. Not sure it exists, but he seem to believe it."
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P1028285017" "There is <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>one</a> who could use your assistance."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P1143469074" "You would be of great help to some of my <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>friends.</a>"
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


