// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Meg_Mason 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 35 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Meg Mason 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P625199324" "Meg Mason"
// ProfessionString :
"P1376784013" "Contracted PPD Liaison"
// DescriptionString :
"P1511279083" "Meg Mason has her ear to the ground and knows what's going on.  She works for the Paragon Police as an incredibly useful contract civilian.  Meg is well-connected, especially when she utilizes the massive number of contacts she's planted within the various gangs of The Hollows.  She's exceptionally good at her job and has always gotten her information the old-fashioned way: infiltration, subterfuge, and a warehouse full of guts."
// HelloString :
"P838512806" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Hey, {HeroName}.  Another day another drama.  Looks like I could use your help again.</a>"
// HelloString :
"P2151718700" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Well, {HeroName}, it looks like the bad guys never sleep, so neither should we.  You up for some action?</a>"
// HelloString :
"P1401901237" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>I've got some work for you, if you've got the time.</a>"
// HelloString :
"P2567069028" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Hey.  I could use your help on something.</a>"
// HelloString :
"P817409974" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>If you've got some time, I could use your help.</a>"
// HelloString :
"P360859809" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>I got a big job for you.  You up for it?</a>"
// HelloString :
"P1760084771" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>This job's pretty important.  I could use a hero with your skills.</a>"
// HelloString :
"P3953856296" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Hey.  Up for some work?</a>"
// HelloString :
"P2107954293" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>You free for an assignment?</a>"
// HelloString :
"P3570174359" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Over here!  I need some of those heroic skills of yours.</a>"
// HelloString :
"P2897459877" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Hi.  I can use your skills if you have a minute.</a>"
// HelloString :
"P933715337" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Today's a good day for an assignment, don't you think?</a>"
// HelloString :
"P3286165477" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>I COULD just stand here and look sensational.  Or I could give you a task and together we can clean up the streets.  What do you say?</a>"
// HelloString :
"P3724217465" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>You know, I've been watching you.  You're pretty good.  Pretty darn good.  I know of some bad guys that need a lesson in ethics and you're the perfect person to instruct them.  Whaddya say, teach?</a>"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P2616029794" "I have no idea who you are.  No business card, no nothing.  Maybe you need to get someone to slip me your info.  Otherwise, I don't know what I'm dealing with here."
// FirstVisitString :
"P2967293074" "It's good to see you, {HeroName}.  Lieutenant Wincott speaks very highly of you.  I'm on retainer by the Paragon Police Department as a contractor with some insight into the gang activity here in The Hollows.  Needless to say, I need all the help I can get.  <br><br>I'm a can-do girl who doesn't like to wait around for results, so if you're interested in working with me, you need to know that all my assignments are on a <color orange>strict deadline</color>.  If that's acceptable to you, I'm sure we'll become fast friends at kicking bad guy butt."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P3553017720" "Looks like we're done here, {HeroName}.  You've been a great help to me, but it's time for you to move on.  Maybe one of your other contacts can use your services now."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P929249408" "I appreciate your enthusiasm, but you have way too much stuff going on to be able to help me.  I need someone who is focused.  Go clear your schedule and come back to me when you have some dedicated time."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P3187594047" "I can't give this job to anyone below Security Level {Level}.  Sorry, I know you want to help.  Come back when you're a bit more seasoned and we'll work together."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P181399460" "You have been a huge help to me.  Check out these new <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>Enhancements.</a> You've earned them.  <br><br>Oh, and write down my number.  I always have plenty of work around here so you can call me any time.  I can definitely use the help."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P406313132" "You've done some great things for me, {HeroName}.  I trust you with anything.  And since you're on my good side, I've got some  <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>new gear,</a> if you're interested."
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P4228214671" "Looks like you've outgrown me.  It's time to move on.  Maybe you should check out Faultline.  They're in deep need for dedicated heroes like you.<br><br>And have a donut for me, too.  I hear they're spectacular."
// LocationString :
// IntroString :
"P754095631" "You should go talk to Meg Mason.  She's working for the Paragon Police in The Hollows.  I know she can use your help, {HeroName}."
// IntroAcceptString :
"P3976401482" "Choose Meg Mason"
// IntroSendoffString :
"P2657874474" "Meg's managed to have her contacts infiltrate nearly every gang in The Hollows.  She'll have some really useful information on how to take them down."
// IntroduceOneContact :
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 


