// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------
// Source File : texts/Working 	Sheet : Talshak_the_Mystic 
//
// Script      : Xlstocontactdef.bat 
// Version     : 35 
// ----------------------------------------------------------------------------------------------

// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Contact Name : Talshak the Mystic 
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 
// Name :
"P1954330130" "Talshak the Mystic"
// ProfessionString :
"P1360647689" "Mystic"
// DescriptionString :
"P1736432071" "Very little is known about Talshak the Mystic. The only thing that is certain is that he is bent on protecting the mystical gateway that is rumored to exist deep within the Hollows. Does Talshak want to prevent the gateway from being used, or simply reserve it for himself? No one knows for sure. Talshak has been quite adept at weaving distracting spells to keep the Circle from its goal. However, the thickheaded Trolls have proved more difficult to dissuade. Talshak is happy to provide heroes with details of the Trolls' activities, in exchange for help in driving the gangsters away."
// LocationString :
// HelloString :
"P3690031974" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>There is work to be done.</a>"
// HelloString :
"P3581602609" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>Greetings. There is much to do.</a>"
// HelloString :
"P1324883674" "<A HREF=CONTACTLINK_MISSIONS>You have a great task ahead of you.</a>"
// IDontKnowYouString :
"P3254550304" "You are not known to me. Seek out {LastContactName}."
// FirstVisitString :
"P2564031597" "Greetings, {HeroName}. I am Talshak the Mystic, and I am older than I look."
// NoTasksRemainingString :
"P2316353928" "Your work for me is done."
// PlayerBusyString :
"P897913874" "Your mind is already occupied. You cannot take on another task."
// ComeBackLaterString :
"P1301412287" "I would not wish this task on anyone below Security Level {Level}."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToFriend :
"P580246643" "My friend, you have impressed me. Some of my more potent <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>charms</a> may be of use to you. If you are in need, {HeroName}, you have only to call."
// RelationshipChangeString_ToConfidant :
"P1212701846" "You are beginning to earn my trust, and that is a difficult feat indeed. I would be happy to provide you with some more <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_GOTOSTORE>Enhancements.</a>"
// FailsafeLevelString :
"P224246228" "I can help you no more, {HeroName}. You will have to seek greater challenges."
// IntroString :
// IntroAcceptString :
// IntroSendoffString :
// IntroduceOneContact :
"P1337152146" "There is <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>one</a> who could use your assistance. But before you leave the Hollows, I hope you will seek out Karsis again. He remains in the Four Seasons, overlooking the Red River."
// IntroduceTwoContacts :
"P2568466763" "You would be of great help to some of my <A HREF=CONTACTLINK_INTRODUCE>friends.</a> But before you leave the Hollows, I hope you will seek out Karsis again. He remains in the Four Seasons, overlooking the Red River."
// -------------------------------------------------------------------------------- 

